OL,3,GNEWSAStruggling to settle in at uni?
OL,4,AStudents share their tips
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreshers Week is over, lectures have
OL,7,Fstarted, money is tight and a group of
OL,8,Fstrangers are hogging the kitchen.
OL,10,FStarting university can feel
OL,11,Foverwhelming, but from joining a sports
OL,12,Fteam to realising you are not alone,
OL,13,Fstudents have been sharing their tips
OL,14,Fon how to settle in.
OL,16,F"Starting uni was a really hard time
OL,17,Ffor me and, as I was only two hours
OL,18,Ffrom Liverpool, the temptation to go
OL,19,Fhome when I felt down was quite
OL,20,Fstrong," Lola-Mae Till says.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
